            "value" : "Coucher du soleil %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The difference between this swing's high and low, %@." : {
      "comment" : "Explains what the tide-range number measures. The placeholder is 'low to high' or 'high to low'."
    },
    "The fast answer is already on this device; next time you're connected, Slackwater refines it to the full %lld-day model — nothing to tap." : {
      "comment" : "Offline prediction-refinement explanation. The integer is the full model length in days.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La respuesta rápida ya está en este dispositivo; la próxima vez que te conectes, Slackwater la refinará al modelo completo de %lld días, sin que tengas que tocar nada."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La réponse rapide est déjà sur cet appareil; à la prochaine connexion, Slackwater l’affinera grâce au modèle complet de %lld jours, sans aucune action de votre part."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highs and lows below are still computed the same way and are still correct. They are just a small movement inside a much larger seasonal one, so a whole day can sit above or below what the same day looks like six months from now." : {
      "comment" : "Reassures that predictions are correct at a seasonal station."
    },
    "The line around now, with the water's height or speed." : {
      "comment" : "Watch complication description.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La curva en torno a ahora, con la altura o la velocidad del agua."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La courbe autour de maintenant, avec la hauteur ou la vitesse de l’eau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The map works offline here: the world, the water around you, and your saved stations." : {
      "comment" : "Offline-map availability summary.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El mapa funciona aquí sin conexión: el mundo, el agua a tu alrededor y tus estaciones guardadas."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La carte fonctionne hors ligne ici : le monde entier, les eaux autour de vous et vos stations enregistrées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Moon is near apogee, its farthest point from Earth. Its weaker tidal effect tends to narrow the range, lowering highs and raising lows compared with perigee." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of the Moon's tidal effect near apogee.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Luna está cerca del apogeo, su punto más lejano de la Tierra. Su efecto de marea más débil tiende a reducir la amplitud, con pleamares más bajas y bajamares más altas que en el perigeo."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Lune est près de l’apogée, son point le plus éloigné de la Terre. Son effet plus faible sur les marées tend à réduire le marnage, avec des hautes eaux moins hautes et des basses eaux moins basses qu’au périgée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Moon is near perigee, its closest point to Earth. Its stronger tidal effect tends to widen the range, raising highs and lowering lows compared with apogee." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of the Moon's tidal effect near perigee.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Luna está cerca del perigeo, su punto más cercano a la Tierra. Su efecto de marea más fuerte tiende a ampliar la amplitud, con pleamares más altas y bajamares más bajas que en el apogeo."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Lune est près du périgée, son point le plus proche de la Terre. Son effet plus fort sur les marées tend à augmenter le marnage, avec des hautes eaux plus hautes et des basses eaux plus basses qu’à l’apogée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new moon crossing the sun as seen from here." : {
      "comment" : "Plain-language explanation of a solar eclipse.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La luna nueva cruza el Sol vista desde aquí."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La nouvelle lune passe devant le Soleil, vue d’ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next event, above the clock." : {
      "comment" : "Slackwater interface text.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El próximo evento, sobre el reloj."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’événement suivant, au-dessus de l’horloge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next high tide at %@ is %@, at %@ %@." : {
      "comment" : "Spoken Siri tide answer. Values are station name, localized date and time, formatted height, and spoken unit.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The next high tide at %1$@ is %2$@, at %3$@ %4$@."
          }
        },
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La próxima pleamar en %1$@ es el %2$@, a las %3$@, con %4$@."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La prochaine marée haute à %1$@ est prévue %2$@ et atteindra %3$@ %4$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next low tide at %@ is %@, at %@ %@." : {
      "comment" : "Spoken Siri tide answer. Values are station name, localized date and time, formatted height, and spoken unit.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The next low tide at %1$@ is %2$@, at %3$@ %4$@."
          }
        },
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La próxima bajamar en %1$@ es el %2$@, a las %3$@, con %4$@."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La prochaine marée basse à %1$@ est prévue %2$@ et atteindra %3$@ %4$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next slack window at %@ is from %@ to %@ and is open now." : {
      "comment" : "Spoken Siri slack-window answer. Values are station name and localized start and end times.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The next slack window at %1$@ is from %2$@ to %3$@ and is open now."
          }
        },
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La próxima ventana de estoa en %1$@ va de %2$@ a %3$@ y está abierta ahora."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La prochaine fenêtre d’étale à %1$@ s’étend de %2$@ à %3$@ et est ouverte maintenant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next slack window at %@ is from %@ to %@, and starts %@." : {
      "comment" : "Spoken Siri slack-window answer. Values are station name, localized start and end times, and a relative start time.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The next slack window at %1$@ is from %2$@ to %3$@, and starts %4$@."
          }
        },
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La próxima ventana de estoa en %1$@ va de %2$@ a %3$@ y comienza %4$@."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La prochaine fenêtre d’étale à %1$@ s’étend de %2$@ à %3$@ et commencera %4$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The on-device fit is still refining. Flood sets %lld°T." : {
      "comment" : "Provisional current-model footer. The integer is the flood direction in degrees true.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The on-device fit is still refining. Flood sets %lld°T."
          }
        },
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El ajuste en el dispositivo aún se está refinando. La corriente de flujo se establece a %lld°T."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’ajustement sur cet appareil s’affine encore. Le flot porte au %lld°T."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The place's curve, its turns and their times." : {
      "comment" : "Watch complication description.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La curva del lugar, sus cambios y sus horas."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La courbe du lieu, ses renversements et leurs heures."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stations on your list download on their own." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of automatic downloads for stations in view.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las estaciones de tu lista se descargan automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les stations de votre liste se téléchargent automatiquement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stations you have opened are ready and stay ready offline. Everything else fills in as you use the app, and nothing downloads twice." : {
      "comment" : "Offline-download progress summary.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las estaciones que has abierto están listas y siguen disponibles sin conexión. Las demás se añaden a medida que usas la app, y ninguna se descarga dos veces."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les stations que vous avez ouvertes sont prêtes et restent disponibles hors ligne. Les autres s’ajoutent à mesure que vous utilisez l’app, et aucune n’est téléchargée deux fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Sun and Moon are at right angles, so their tidal effects partly offset. The narrower range tends to bring lower highs and higher lows." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of a neap tide.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El Sol y la Luna forman un ángulo recto, por lo que sus efectos de marea se compensan en parte. La menor amplitud tiende a producir pleamares más bajas y bajamares más altas."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le Soleil et la Lune sont à angle droit, de sorte que leurs effets sur les marées se compensent en partie. Le marnage réduit tend à produire des hautes eaux moins hautes et des basses eaux moins basses."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Sun and Moon line up, reinforcing each other's tidal effects. The wider range tends to bring higher highs and lower lows." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of a spring tide.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El Sol y la Luna están alineados y refuerzan mutuamente sus efectos de marea. La mayor amplitud tiende a producir pleamares más altas y bajamares más bajas."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le Soleil et la Lune sont alignés, ce qui renforce leurs effets sur les marées. Le marnage accru tend à produire des hautes eaux plus hautes et des basses eaux plus basses."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The water at %@ has a real tide, and a yearly cycle of about the same size. The times below are unaffected — high and low arrive when they arrive — but the heights drift across the year as the seasonal level rises and falls underneath them." : {
      "comment" : "Explains a station whose annual cycle is comparable to its tide. The placeholder is a place name."
    },
    "The water at %@ rises and falls far more across a year than it does across a day. Rivers, lakes and lagoons behave this way: the level follows the seasons — runoff, rainfall, wind — and the daily tide is a ripple on top of it." : {
      "comment" : "Explains a station whose annual cycle dominates its tide. The placeholder is a place name."
    },
    "The water now and which way it's going." : {
      "comment" : "Watch complication description.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El agua ahora, y hacia dónde va."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’eau maintenant, et dans quel sens elle va."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then" : {
      "comment" : "Following lunar-eclipse label.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después"
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This alert repeats. There's no single moment to switch back to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta alerta se repite. No hay un momento único al que volver."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette alerte se répète. Il n’y a pas de moment unique auquel revenir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This one" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta"
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Celle-ci"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This station is no longer published." : {
      "comment" : "Removed-station explanation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta estación ya no se publica."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette station n’est plus publiée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This station stays available offline when finished." : {
      "comment" : "Station download expectation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This station stays available offline when finished."
          }
        },
        "es-ES" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
